1
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,240
Hello.

2
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,160
What are you doing here?

3
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:00,480
I came to see my uncle.
We have something to discuss.

4
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:06,720
Just kidding.

5
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,600
I'm here for a dermatology appointment.

6
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,280
It's all Zhang Qi's fault.

7
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,760
To save time,
he just got water from some random place.

8
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,960
Look. I've got a rash on my neck.

9
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,520
Come to think of it,
I have you to thank for that.

10
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:22,320
I thought the rules of the game
were perfectly clear.

11
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:29,880
But I always thought

12
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,840
that it was just the two of us

13
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,280
in this game.

14
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:58,400
A WHITE COAT, A PURE HEART,
ENTIRELY DEVOTED TO THE PATIENT

15
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:00,600
What's wrong?
Did something happen with your mom?

16
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,280
No.

17
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,720
I just wanted to ask.

18
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:07,280
The Compassionate Care Bed program needs
patient information submitted each year.

19
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,120
Why haven't we heard anything this year?

20
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,360
Compassionate Care Bed?

21
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:11,720
Just a moment.

22
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:15,040
It's not time to submit it yet.

23
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,800
- When do we submit it then?
- Next month.

24
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,600
Don't worry. I'll be sure to remind you.

25
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:26,000
CORE INTRODUCTION
TO REHABILITATION THERAPY

26
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:35,040
DOCTOR TEAM
XIE LIMING

27
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,440
XIAOCHEN

28
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:43,240
<i>Xiaozheng came by shortly after you left.</i>

29
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:45,040
<i>Didn't you run into her?</i>

30
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,160
<i>No.</i>

31
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:53,200
<i>I gave her the drink.</i>

32
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:55,120
<i>She didn't suspect a thing.</i>

33
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:58,960
<i>Let's keep it a secret.</i>

34
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,360
Xiaozheng.

35
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:06,240
Someone came looking for you
while you were away.

36
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,040
- Who?
- Take a guess.

37
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:12,200
I have no idea.

38
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,520
Okay, I'll tell you.

39
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:16,959
Your brother. Xiaomian.

40
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,880
He came by before the semester started.

41
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:21,279
The day you went to the beach.

42
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:24,200
What did he come for?

43
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:27,640
He took the study list
for the College Entrance Exam

44
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,840
you left for him in your drawer.

45
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:35,200
I only made that list while preparing
lessons for a student I tutor.

46
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,480
I just wrote one for him too.

47
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,000
OUTPATIENT MEDICAL RECORD
NAME: CHEN YANZHOU

48
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,880
JI HENG HOSPITAL OF QINGYI CITY
COMPLETE BLOOD COUNT

49
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:09,640
FRONTIERS IN PLANT SCIENCE

50
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:15,320
Your article really got published
in this magazine.

51
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,920
I didn't expect much when I submitted it.

52
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:21,440
I never thought they'd actually accept it.

53
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:28,720
Is this what you were
talking about last time?

54
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,400
HIGH SCHOOL ENTRANCE EXAM MOCK TEST (1)

55
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:32,040
TOPIC 4: PEACEFUL GLOBAL DEVELOPMENT

56
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,520
What's so interesting about this?

57
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,800
If you want to read something,

58
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,960
it should at least be an article
published in a journal.

59
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:55,040
How would I understand
your technical articles?

60
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,600
Xie Yudi.

61
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:08,680
If I were you,
I'd ask Zheng Yu for compensation.

62
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,600
How could I make her pay?

63
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:15,040
Besides, what could she
possibly pay me with?

64
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,840
- Let me ask you something.
- Go ahead.

65
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,440
Have a seat.

66
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:29,720
So I have this friend.

67
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:33,160
In his freshman year, he met a girl.

68
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:36,760
The girl has a mom in a vegetative state.

69
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:40,880
My friend saw how tough
things were for her,

70
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:42,240
so he referred her to a hospital.

71
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:46,200
None of their classmates knew that the
girl's mom was in a vegetative state.

72
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,800
My friend…

73
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:51,040
He liked her.

74
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,080
So he decided to keep it a secret for her.

75
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,400
Later,

76
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,960
he wanted to visit her mom,

77
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:00,560
but the girl wouldn't let him
into the room.

78
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,600
They even had a huge argument.

79
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:04,880
Why?

80
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,680
The girl's reason was that

81
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:10,640
she didn't want anyone
invading her privacy.

82
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,240
She said that her mom was her bottom line.

83
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:14,800
Anyway, I don't remember
the details anymore.

84
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,920
But basically,

85
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:21,600
she wouldn't let him visit her mom
or help her in any way.

86
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:27,680
My friend realized she was being
quite paranoid about it all,

87
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:28,880
so he didn't dare go back.

88
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:30,800
You…

89
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:33,800
I didn't know your friend
could be such a coward.

90
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,200
But today,

91
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:40,560
he saw another guy

92
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:42,760
taking care of her mom
in the hospital room.

93
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,520
And it didn't seem like
his first time either.

94
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,840
A backup option.

95
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:49,880
You mean that guy?

96
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:52,480
With you… I mean, your friend.

97
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,040
With your friend,

98
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:57,960
she acts all noble and righteous.

99
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:01,600
Money and favors can't sway her.

100
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:04,640
That makes your friend think that
she's independent and strong,

101
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,440
which only makes him love her more.

102
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,000
But with the other guy,

103
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:11,240
she acts like
she can't do anything herself.

104
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,960
She depends on him for everything,

105
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:16,640
making him feel needed
and like he's some kind of hero.

106
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:21,040
This girl sure knows
how to play both sides.

107
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:33,679
Hey! Everyone, I have an announcement.

108
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:37,679
In line with our college's
annual tradition,

109
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,679
after the Field Practice Report is done,

110
00:08:39,760 --> 00:08:42,159
we'll hold a specimen exhibition
open to the whole university

111
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:45,760
to showcase the specimens you collected.

112
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:48,400
We'll also team up
with the university's Charity Club

113
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:50,400
to hold a charity bazaar.

114
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:53,080
As for the specific date,
location, and requirements,

115
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:55,320
I will post that info
in the group chat later today.

116
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:57,760
I hope everyone will participate
and help spread the word.

117
00:08:57,840 --> 00:09:00,320
Let's aim to raise more
than last year's total!

118
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:02,320
- All right?
- All right!

119
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:03,440
Okay.

120
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:05,040
How much did they raise last year?

121
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:07,480
I don't know,
but I heard it was a big hit.

122
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:08,840
I even went to check it out.

123
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:09,800
Really?

124
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:10,720
Let's check it out.

125
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:12,640
You go ahead. I'll pass.

126
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,760
Then how do I sign up?

127
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,000
How would I know?

128
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,360
When we first started freshman year,

129
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,360
Zheng Yu used her mom's condition
to make me feel sorry for her.

130
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:36,360
She got tens of thousands from me,

131
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,240
then dumped me as soon as she'd spent it.

132
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:42,440
She wouldn't even let me visit her mom.

133
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:46,480
Then why did you go
to the hospital that day?

134
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,960
I just wanted to see which sucker…

135
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,040
was taking care of her mom for her.

136
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,000
Be careful.

137
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,400
I'm just warning you

138
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:09,280
not to make the same mistake I did

139
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,360
of becoming someone else's ATM.

140
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,680
That money you mentioned.

141
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:17,720
Did she pay you back?

142
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:22,560
Why?

143
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:25,160
Are you planning to pay it back for her?

144
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:30,160
I shouldn't waste this golden opportunity
to be her ATM, right?

145
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:38,320
Looks like she's already paid it all back.

146
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,520
What a shame.

147
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:42,400
Who says she's paid it all back?

148
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:53,080
Then make sure you calculate it carefully
and send me the exact amount.

149
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:56,400
Oh, right.

150
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,440
We haven't added each other on WeChat.

151
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:02,920
Scan me.

152
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,040
Are you two dating?

153
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:23,800
Is dating the only
kind of relationship there is?

154
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:30,000
Do you think trust and support
can only exist in a romantic relationship?

155
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:33,040
The way you ask that

156
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,520
almost makes me feel sorry for you.

157
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,400
What a nightmare.

158
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:09,680
I've been in the hospital so long that
weeds are probably growing at home.

159
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:12,200
At least the weeds
haven't grown over your grave.

160
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:14,160
Just try drinking yourself
into that state again!

161
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:17,320
- Take that.
- Someone's here. Stop talking.

162
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:19,240
What's wrong with scolding you a bit?

163
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,680
Whose pajamas are these?

164
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:07,520
They've been in the washer all night.

165
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:10,680
Can you take them out once they're done?
Other people need to do their laundry too.

166
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:14,080
Wait a second.
I think they're my roommate's.

167
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:23,880
Zhuang Ning.

168
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:26,240
You left your clothes in the laundry room.

169
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:29,920
Zhuang Ning?

170
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:18,800
XIE YUDI

171
00:14:56,880 --> 00:14:58,600
I'm taking attendance at random.

172
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:02,360
- Feng Yuting.
- Here.

173
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:04,840
- Zhang Qi.
- Here.

174
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:08,560
- Liu Linlin.
- Here.

175
00:15:09,400 --> 00:15:10,240
Zhuang Ning.

176
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,640
Is Zhuang Ning here?

177
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,240
She went to the restroom, ma'am.

178
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,760
- Her things are still here.
- Yes.

179
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:22,880
Guo Xiao.

180
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,360
Guo Xiao.

181
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,720
The semester has only just started,
and you're already skipping class?

182
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:36,640
Are you okay?

183
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:51,320
Xie Yudi called you last night.

184
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,360
I answered.

185
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:55,040
Why?

186
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,640
Didn't you tell me before

187
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:59,640
that you hated it when I told him
anything about you?

188
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,320
If so, you should stay away from me.

189
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:04,040
Don't touch my things,

190
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,400
and don't answer my calls.

191
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:09,240
Are you in elementary school?

192
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,080
What I mean is,

193
00:16:14,160 --> 00:16:16,960
you can't solve everything
by drawing a hard line.

194
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:22,600
If you're avoiding me because you're
afraid of getting me into trouble,

195
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:24,960
you don't have to.

196
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:30,960
Then how am I supposed to deal with this?

197
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:37,800
First, tell me why
you're so afraid of Xie Yudi.

198
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,840
Is it because of…

199
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:46,160
This?

200
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:53,600
When I answered the call last night,

201
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:56,400
I suddenly remembered you'd told me

202
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:58,600
that you and Xie Yudi
were high school classmates.

203
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:01,160
<i>So I searched your name online.</i>

204
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:02,920
HOMETOWN ASSOCIATION REGISTRATION FORM

205
00:17:04,359 --> 00:17:07,040
ZHUANG NING

206
00:17:07,119 --> 00:17:09,319
XIE YUDI

207
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:13,520
<i>Recently, false rumors have spread</i>
<i>around school that Xie bullied Zhuang.</i>

208
00:17:13,599 --> 00:17:17,440
<i>I came across your school notice.</i>
<i>It said you both had a dispute.</i>

209
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:21,480
<i>At around 4:00 p.m., March 20,</i>
<i>a dispute arose between Xie and Zhuang</i>

210
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:24,720
<i>because Xie splashed paint</i>
<i>and stained Zhuang's clothes.</i>

211
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,520
<i>Other students witnessed the incident.</i>

212
00:17:26,599 --> 00:17:28,960
<i>During the confrontation,</i>
<i>the two pushed each other.</i>

213
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:31,120
<i>Zhuang then accidentally</i>
<i>fell down the stairs,</i>

214
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,480
<i>fracturing her collarbone.</i>

215
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:35,960
<i>Xie has since shown remorse</i>
<i>and paid the medical expenses.</i>

216
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,640
<i>Both parties have reached a settlement.</i>

217
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:40,120
Zhuang Ning,
why is your collarbone sitting so high?

218
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:48,600
Can you tell me now
what happened between you and Xie Yudi?

219
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:53,560
How did I never notice before
how nosy you are?

220
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:58,680
Anyway, I'll graduate in a year.

221
00:17:58,760 --> 00:18:01,680
After that, we'll never cross paths again.

222
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:02,840
It'll all be over.

223
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:06,320
Is a year that short?

224
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:12,040
For people who go through life
without much trouble,

225
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:13,440
I guess it is.

226
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:16,680
But for those who have
to force themselves through each day

227
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:18,560
just to keep going,

228
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:20,960
even a single day

229
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:22,960
can feel endless.

230
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,280
Do you really want to hear it?

231
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:46,680
Honestly,

232
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:51,920
<i>I don't even know what started</i>
<i>all of this in the first place.</i>

233
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:55,720
<i>I think it all changed starting that day.</i>

234
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:56,680
Xie Yudi.

235
00:18:56,760 --> 00:18:58,920
Have you turned in
your Chinese homework yet?

236
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:01,760
I did, class rep. You must've missed it.

237
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:08,880
Yours isn't here.

238
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,280
Then I must've forgotten to do it.

239
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,480
Can't you let it slide this time?

240
00:19:24,040 --> 00:19:26,720
Mr. Li said to write down
the names of anyone who didn't do it.

241
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:30,360
I'll write down your name first,
then I'll explain it to Mr. Li for you.

242
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,160
XIE YUDI

243
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:34,720
Zhang Wei.
Where's your Chinese homework?

244
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:41,440
SCHOOL: HENGJIANG HIGH SCHOOL
NAME: ZHANG WEI

245
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:47,480
NAME: XIE YUDI

246
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:57,920
Then please change the name for me.

247
00:19:59,080 --> 00:20:00,240
Thank you.

248
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:05,960
<i>After that day,</i>
<i>they seemed to be everywhere.</i>

249
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:07,280
Really?

250
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:09,960
<i>It seemed like</i>
<i>they weren't doing anything,</i>

251
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:13,080
<i>but it was still unbearable.</i>

252
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:18,520
<i>Xie Yudi was popular in our class.</i>

253
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:21,000
<i>Whatever he did, others followed suit.</i>

254
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:24,280
<i>And their numbers kept growing.</i>

255
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:30,160
<i>At first, it was just a few</i>
<i>unexplainable glances.</i>

256
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:32,040
<i>Gradually…</i>

257
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:32,960
Hey, look at her.

258
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:35,400
<i>It turned into little jokes</i>
<i>and snide remarks.</i>

259
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,080
Zhuang Ning, did you just
come back from the restroom?

260
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:42,960
<i>Besides me,</i>

261
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:45,280
<i>nobody else cared.</i>

262
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:49,560
<i>Everyone thought</i>
<i>it was just jokes between classmates.</i>

263
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:54,200
<i>But those so-called jokes</i>
<i>kept testing my limits.</i>

264
00:20:54,280 --> 00:20:56,000
<i>And they kept getting worse.</i>

265
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:12,760
Class rep, sorry about that.

266
00:21:12,840 --> 00:21:14,840
My shoes are a little too big.

267
00:21:31,520 --> 00:21:32,520
That looks painful.

268
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:34,800
Need any help?

269
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:38,680
<i>It's not like I never fought back.</i>

270
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:41,840
<i>You said you found that notice online.</i>

271
00:21:42,560 --> 00:21:43,600
<i>It was that time.</i>

272
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:48,000
Xie Yudi's grades have always been good.

273
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:51,840
I've never heard of him
doing anything to bully his classmates.

274
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:54,360
- Why are you accusing him?
<i>- It hurt so much that day.</i>

275
00:21:54,960 --> 00:21:58,920
<i>It felt like my whole body,</i>
<i>from head to toe, inside and out,</i>

276
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,760
<i>didn't have a single spot left unharmed.</i>

277
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:05,520
<i>I told the teacher about it,</i>
<i>but he didn't believe me.</i>

278
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:08,560
<i>He even said I was overthinking it.</i>

279
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:11,600
<i>Because he usually</i>
<i>put up such a good façade,</i>

280
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:14,360
<i>no one believed a model student</i>
<i>would do something like that.</i>

281
00:22:22,520 --> 00:22:25,600
<i>I spent the whole night thinking about it.</i>

282
00:22:26,320 --> 00:22:28,080
<i>If it came down to it,</i>
<i>we'd go down together.</i>

283
00:22:29,120 --> 00:22:32,520
<i>I even kept a utility knife</i>
<i>in my pocket just in case.</i>

284
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:35,560
<i>And guess what happened?</i>

285
00:22:36,760 --> 00:22:39,240
<i>He showed up</i>
<i>at my family's breakfast shop.</i>

286
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:42,320
Xiaoning, your classmate
is here to see you.

287
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:44,080
He says you two are pretty close.

288
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:49,840
Morning.

289
00:22:58,040 --> 00:22:59,520
<i>Your parents told me</i>

290
00:22:59,600 --> 00:23:01,560
you missed a step
and fell down the stairs.

291
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:04,800
Good.

292
00:23:05,600 --> 00:23:07,560
The better you behave,
the less I'll come around.

293
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:14,800
Take them.

294
00:23:20,880 --> 00:23:23,880
<i>That was when I finally understood.</i>

295
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:25,920
<i>Fighting back against him</i>

296
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:29,200
<i>would take far more effort</i>
<i>than enduring him.</i>

297
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:32,840
<i>He could ruin my life,</i>

298
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:35,280
<i>but not my parents'.</i>

299
00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:40,440
<i>Later, I watched a documentary.</i>

300
00:23:40,520 --> 00:23:43,040
<i>It showed barnacles that cling</i>
<i>to whales in huge numbers,</i>

301
00:23:44,120 --> 00:23:46,040
<i>making it hard for them to swim,</i>

302
00:23:46,120 --> 00:23:48,360
<i>to breathe,</i>

303
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:50,360
<i>even to make a sound,</i>

304
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:52,680
<i>until they slowly sink into the deep sea.</i>

305
00:23:53,280 --> 00:23:54,920
<i>That's what he is to me.</i>

306
00:23:56,280 --> 00:23:58,440
<i>A barnacle clinging to my body.</i>

307
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:01,680
<i>He won't kill me outright,</i>

308
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:03,480
<i>but…</i>

309
00:24:04,040 --> 00:24:07,160
<i>I'll never be able</i>
<i>to get away from him on my own.</i>

310
00:24:10,280 --> 00:24:12,960
When the College Entrance Exam was over,

311
00:24:13,600 --> 00:24:16,480
I thought I'd finally be free of him.

312
00:24:17,760 --> 00:24:19,360
But I never expected

313
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:23,680
that I'd end up
at the same university as him,

314
00:24:23,760 --> 00:24:25,080
in the same major.

315
00:24:28,040 --> 00:24:29,560
After everything you've told me,

316
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:33,880
you still think you can
put an end to this after graduation?

317
00:24:37,280 --> 00:24:38,840
Have you ever considered…

318
00:24:44,320 --> 00:24:47,280
XU FANGLI

319
00:24:50,600 --> 00:24:53,280
You… should get back to class.

320
00:24:53,360 --> 00:24:56,480
If you get caught, you could lose
your scholarship this semester.

321
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:07,240
You have a fever.

322
00:25:07,320 --> 00:25:08,840
I'll take you to the infirmary. Let's go.

323
00:25:38,080 --> 00:25:39,080
You're still a little warm.

324
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:40,760
Have something to eat.

325
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:43,840
I…

326
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:46,080
I don't really have an appetite. You eat.

327
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:50,000
The doctor said you fainted
because your blood sugar was low.

328
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:52,960
Eat or don't. It's up to you.

329
00:25:54,120 --> 00:25:55,920
I'll lie down on the next bed.

330
00:26:32,320 --> 00:26:33,640
You should get back to class.

331
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:36,520
They've already taken attendance.

332
00:26:36,600 --> 00:26:39,520
If your seat stays empty,
they'll notice sooner or later.

333
00:26:40,840 --> 00:26:42,800
The university rules don't say

334
00:26:43,760 --> 00:26:45,320
that you have to ignore a friend in need

335
00:26:46,560 --> 00:26:48,080
just to keep your attendance up.

336
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:52,320
A friend?

337
00:27:01,960 --> 00:27:02,920
Then…

338
00:27:03,000 --> 00:27:05,680
I'll message Linlin first

339
00:27:05,760 --> 00:27:07,800
and ask her to request sick leave
for both of us.

340
00:27:08,560 --> 00:27:09,640
No, wait.

341
00:27:09,720 --> 00:27:11,640
I should call her instead.

342
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:13,960
She probably isn't looking
at her phone right now.

343
00:27:14,040 --> 00:27:16,560
CALL LOG, XIE YUDI

344
00:27:18,280 --> 00:27:19,360
You lied to me.

345
00:27:22,520 --> 00:27:25,000
You never answered Xie Yudi's call.

346
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:31,360
Zheng Yu.

347
00:27:48,120 --> 00:27:50,640
You also keep putting up with Xie Yudi

348
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:52,520
without saying a word.

349
00:27:53,320 --> 00:27:55,200
Why do you do that?

350
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:28,400
It's raining.

351
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:39,040
Aren't you going
to take your bag and umbrella?

352
00:28:45,800 --> 00:28:46,880
Thank you.

353
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:50,600
I wasn't sure if you'd forgotten them.

354
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:52,400
I waited for you in class,
but you never showed.

355
00:28:52,480 --> 00:28:53,640
So I brought them over.

356
00:28:53,720 --> 00:28:56,840
Why didn't you go inside?
How long have you been waiting here?

357
00:28:58,480 --> 00:28:59,400
Not that long.

358
00:29:05,520 --> 00:29:06,560
Did something happen?

359
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:09,760
Chen Yanzhou.

360
00:29:10,320 --> 00:29:12,760
I need your help with something.

361
00:29:12,840 --> 00:29:15,920
Do you have the contact info for the owner
of the base where we did our fieldwork?

362
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:29,880
SPECIMEN DETAILS

363
00:29:29,960 --> 00:29:31,720
PERFORMING ACTS OF CHARITY WITH SPECIMENS

364
00:29:31,800 --> 00:29:33,680
USING SPECIMENS TO SPREAD KINDNESS

365
00:29:33,760 --> 00:29:35,440
SPECIMEN CHARITY BAZAAR

366
00:29:36,080 --> 00:29:37,760
QING YI UNIVERSITY, CHARITY CLUB

367
00:29:43,280 --> 00:29:45,600
GET CLOSER TO NATURE,
EXPLORE LIFE, SPREAD KINDNESS

368
00:29:50,280 --> 00:29:52,360
TURNING RESPECT FOR LIFE
INTO GENTLE ACTION

369
00:29:55,280 --> 00:29:57,280
Thanks. We couldn't have
done it without you.

370
00:29:57,360 --> 00:29:59,720
You gathered all these photos
and even put this video together.

371
00:30:00,320 --> 00:30:02,680
We've known each other for ages.
It's the least I could do.

372
00:30:03,280 --> 00:30:06,040
Right, about that thing
I mentioned last time…

373
00:30:07,000 --> 00:30:07,880
No problem.

374
00:30:07,960 --> 00:30:10,200
It'll help make our event
more interesting.

375
00:30:11,360 --> 00:30:13,200
- You should check everything again.
- Okay.

376
00:30:13,760 --> 00:30:15,040
How did this balloon get in here?

377
00:30:16,360 --> 00:30:17,720
Carry on. I'll take it outside.

378
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:19,600
- Okay, bye.
- Bye.

379
00:30:35,120 --> 00:30:36,800
Didn't we agree to go together?

380
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:38,640
I'm going to be late
because I'm waiting for you.

381
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:40,600
<i>I know exactly what you're up to.</i>

382
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:42,560
<i>You pretend to invite me</i>
<i>to the exhibition,</i>

383
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:45,400
<i>but in reality, you want me</i>
<i>to buy your group's specimens,</i>

384
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:47,760
<i>preferably paying a high price for them.</i>

385
00:30:47,840 --> 00:30:48,840
<i>Unfortunately,</i>

386
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:51,160
<i>the college assigned me</i>
<i>something else to do today.</i>

387
00:30:51,240 --> 00:30:52,280
I can act as a proxy buyer.

388
00:30:52,360 --> 00:30:54,880
<i>You… Never mind, I'll do it.</i>

389
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:56,960
<i>All right, I've got work to do. Bye.</i>

390
00:30:57,040 --> 00:30:59,160
EXHIBITION & CHARITY BAZAAR
ENTRANCE

391
00:31:02,760 --> 00:31:04,720
If you've just arrived,
please come over here first.

392
00:31:04,800 --> 00:31:07,120
- This is really well-made.
- Let's go.

393
00:31:07,200 --> 00:31:09,720
- This one looks nice.
- This one's so pretty.

394
00:31:11,520 --> 00:31:12,640
This one looks nice.

395
00:31:15,800 --> 00:31:17,040
Hello, everyone.

396
00:31:17,120 --> 00:31:20,320
Welcome to
the "Getting Closer to Nature" exhibition,

397
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:22,400
a specimen exhibition jointly hosted by

398
00:31:22,480 --> 00:31:25,560
the Charity Club and Qing Yi University's
College of Life Sciences.

399
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:27,120
Our charity bazaar will begin shortly.

400
00:31:27,200 --> 00:31:29,760
Please take your seats
as soon as possible.

401
00:31:31,040 --> 00:31:32,080
Let's go.

402
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:34,080
- Let's check that one out.
- Sure.

403
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:35,720
- Let's go.
- Sure.

404
00:31:37,400 --> 00:31:40,360
All the specimens on display today

405
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:44,520
were handmade by our junior-year
Life Sciences students.

406
00:31:44,600 --> 00:31:46,760
Every piece is one-of-a-kind.

407
00:31:46,840 --> 00:31:50,400
All of these specimens
will be available for purchase.

408
00:31:50,480 --> 00:31:52,240
As our Charity Club pledges,

409
00:31:52,320 --> 00:31:56,280
all proceeds from the sales
will go entirely toward

410
00:31:56,360 --> 00:31:57,240
charitable causes.

411
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:01,240
To make a purchase,

412
00:32:01,320 --> 00:32:05,040
scan the QR code on the screen
to view detailed information

413
00:32:05,120 --> 00:32:07,320
about all the pieces on display.

414
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:09,040
Choose a piece you're interested in,

415
00:32:09,120 --> 00:32:12,760
then enter online
the maximum amount you're willing to pay.

416
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:14,200
After the exhibition,

417
00:32:14,280 --> 00:32:18,480
we'll review the bids and select
the highest bidder for each piece,

418
00:32:18,560 --> 00:32:20,280
then use the address provided

419
00:32:20,360 --> 00:32:23,880
to mail the piece or deliver it directly
to the winner's dorm.

420
00:32:24,600 --> 00:32:26,480
- That's strange.
- What's wrong?

421
00:32:27,560 --> 00:32:29,560
I saw Zheng Yu's specimen,
and it looked really nice.

422
00:32:29,640 --> 00:32:31,200
So I tried to place a bid.

423
00:32:31,280 --> 00:32:33,160
It says it's already been sold.

424
00:32:33,240 --> 00:32:36,120
How is that possible?
Isn't there supposed to be an auction?

425
00:32:36,200 --> 00:32:39,400
All right, that's everything
I wanted to share with you.

426
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:42,480
Our charity bazaar is now
officially starting!

427
00:32:50,960 --> 00:32:53,320
I'd like to take
a few more minutes of your time.

428
00:32:53,400 --> 00:32:56,480
We have another collection
of special pieces.

429
00:32:56,560 --> 00:32:57,840
SPECIAL AUCTION PIECE

430
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:01,520
Aren't those Zheng Yu's specimens?

431
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:06,720
We have a classmate

432
00:33:06,800 --> 00:33:09,280
whose dad died when she was a child.

433
00:33:10,360 --> 00:33:12,960
Then, just before she reached adulthood,
her mom was in a car accident

434
00:33:13,760 --> 00:33:15,200
and was left in a vegetative state.

435
00:33:15,760 --> 00:33:17,040
I remember

436
00:33:17,120 --> 00:33:18,840
the original purpose of
this charity bazaar

437
00:33:18,920 --> 00:33:21,240
was to spread kindness through our work.

438
00:33:21,840 --> 00:33:23,400
That kindness

439
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:25,080
has reached people far and wide,

440
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:28,800
yet somehow it has never reached
this particular classmate,

441
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:30,880
even though she needs it so much.

442
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:34,960
So

443
00:33:35,800 --> 00:33:38,480
I spoke with the charity bazaar organizers

444
00:33:38,560 --> 00:33:42,800
and selected this student's specimen
for a special auction.

445
00:33:43,400 --> 00:33:45,520
Everyone is welcome
to join the live bidding.

446
00:33:46,520 --> 00:33:48,480
This is the true meaning
behind holding this event.

447
00:33:48,560 --> 00:33:49,680
I think so too.

448
00:33:54,040 --> 00:33:56,600
Here is an update on her mom's condition.

449
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:58,400
I hope you'll show your support.

450
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,440
Zheng Yu.

451
00:34:09,239 --> 00:34:10,600
As the person involved,

452
00:34:11,679 --> 00:34:13,560
would you like to come up
and say a few words?

453
00:34:29,320 --> 00:34:32,880
Xie Yudi! Did you get her consent
before doing all this?

454
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:36,320
You discussed it with the Charity Club,
but didn't even bother consulting her?!

455
00:34:36,400 --> 00:34:37,960
- Exactly!
- Exactly!

456
00:34:38,040 --> 00:34:39,920
- How could he do that?
- How could he?

457
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:42,560
- Did you discuss it behind her back?
- Right, did you?

458
00:34:42,639 --> 00:34:43,560
No, that's not…

459
00:34:43,639 --> 00:34:45,679
Well… This has nothing to do with us!

460
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:52,480
Live bidding is now open.
Who's willing to bid?

461
00:34:59,120 --> 00:35:00,840
I chose to do this,

462
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:03,520
so I'm willing to accept any criticism.

463
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:07,680
I believe that what's more important
than these objections

464
00:35:08,360 --> 00:35:12,080
is to give Zheng Yu some actual help.

465
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:15,720
I hope everyone here

466
00:35:16,720 --> 00:35:20,640
will show their support
and join me in helping Zheng Yu.

467
00:35:32,280 --> 00:35:33,800
What's going on?

468
00:35:35,120 --> 00:35:37,360
Someone's getting beaten up!

469
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,840
Stop fighting!

470
00:36:00,920 --> 00:36:02,040
Come on, stop fighting!

471
00:36:02,120 --> 00:36:03,760
- Chen Yanzhou!
- Calm down!

472
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:06,000
That's enough, Yanzhou! Stop!

473
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:17,880
- Don't! Don't do it!
- Stop fighting!

474
00:37:23,400 --> 00:37:26,360
We've just seen the college buildings
and the lecture halls.

475
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:28,880
This here is an exhibition hall.

476
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:31,800
It's shared by several colleges.

477
00:37:31,880 --> 00:37:34,480
Whenever we need to hold an event
or put on an exhibition,

478
00:37:34,560 --> 00:37:35,560
we usually use this space.

479
00:37:35,640 --> 00:37:36,680
Take a look.

480
00:37:37,320 --> 00:37:39,520
These are all made by our students.

481
00:37:40,040 --> 00:37:40,880
That's right.

482
00:37:40,960 --> 00:37:44,360
This charity bazaar is actually
a traditional event held by our college.

483
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:46,160
It just so happens
to be taking place today,

484
00:37:46,240 --> 00:37:48,400
so we brought all the officials
over to have a look.

485
00:37:50,400 --> 00:37:52,680
It certainly sounds lively.

486
00:37:53,520 --> 00:37:57,680
Our college has always taken
an open-minded approach to our students.

487
00:37:57,760 --> 00:37:59,880
I don't care what others think.

488
00:37:59,960 --> 00:38:03,160
I've always believed that
while you're young,

489
00:38:03,240 --> 00:38:04,480
you should make some waves.

490
00:38:04,560 --> 00:38:06,760
- Am I right?
- Yes, absolutely!

491
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:07,760
Just listen to that.

492
00:38:07,840 --> 00:38:10,560
That's what young people
full of energy sound like.

493
00:38:10,640 --> 00:38:11,720
Exactly.

494
00:38:11,800 --> 00:38:13,160
Let's go inside and take a look.

495
00:38:13,240 --> 00:38:14,440
I'm looking forward to it.

496
00:38:14,520 --> 00:38:16,480
- Let's go.
- All right, let's go.

497
00:38:16,560 --> 00:38:17,720
After you.

498
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:20,920
Actually, our students' greatest strength

499
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:23,680
is their hands-on skills.

500
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:34,640
Everyone, stop! What are you doing?

501
00:38:39,240 --> 00:38:41,400
This is just a rehearsal…

502
00:38:48,920 --> 00:38:51,400
Xie Yudi has really screwed us over.

503
00:38:51,480 --> 00:38:53,920
Don't you think
the name Xie Yudi sounds familiar?

504
00:38:55,160 --> 00:38:57,080
I think I heard some gossip
about him recently.

505
00:38:57,160 --> 00:38:59,040
You mean the rumors that
he bullied a classmate?

506
00:38:59,720 --> 00:39:01,120
I heard about that too.

507
00:39:01,200 --> 00:39:03,320
Do you think it's true?

508
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:05,480
How could someone like that
be at our university?

509
00:39:05,560 --> 00:39:06,640
You never know.

510
00:39:06,720 --> 00:39:09,320
I don't think these rumors
came out of nowhere.

511
00:39:10,160 --> 00:39:12,240
Who do you think started these rumors?

512
00:39:13,720 --> 00:39:15,480
- I don't know.
- No idea.

513
00:39:17,840 --> 00:39:20,160
Speak up. What happened?

514
00:39:22,800 --> 00:39:26,120
Dean. Chen Yanzhou was the one
who threw the first punch.

515
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,280
Dean.

516
00:39:29,360 --> 00:39:31,560
I know Chen Yanzhou fairly well.

517
00:39:31,640 --> 00:39:34,480
He's not the kind of student
who hits people for no reason.

518
00:39:36,080 --> 00:39:38,960
Mr. Li, there were plenty of people
watching what happened.

519
00:39:39,040 --> 00:39:42,720
You can't just smooth things over
with a few words and call it a day.

520
00:39:46,080 --> 00:39:47,040
Chen Yanzhou.

521
00:39:48,200 --> 00:39:49,400
Do you have anything to say?

522
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:53,800
Fine.

523
00:39:55,080 --> 00:39:56,640
There are security cameras in the hall.

524
00:39:56,720 --> 00:40:00,280
We'll find out what happened
and who struck first

525
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:01,600
by checking the footage.

526
00:40:01,680 --> 00:40:02,680
Dean…

527
00:40:03,480 --> 00:40:05,440
The exhibition hall uses
old security cameras.

528
00:40:05,520 --> 00:40:07,000
They have no backup power,

529
00:40:07,080 --> 00:40:09,440
so the cameras went offline
when the power was cut.

530
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:14,600
Well, even if we don't have footage,
there were plenty of students there!

531
00:40:14,680 --> 00:40:17,000
We still need to get to the bottom
of what actually happened!

532
00:40:25,040 --> 00:40:25,880
Zheng Yu.

533
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:30,080
I called you in to get
a better understanding of what happened.

534
00:40:31,320 --> 00:40:33,720
Did you know beforehand
about what happened

535
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:35,680
at today's charity bazaar?

536
00:40:36,440 --> 00:40:37,640
What exactly do you mean?

537
00:40:38,640 --> 00:40:42,800
I mean Xie Yudi's
fundraising for your mom.

538
00:40:44,840 --> 00:40:45,680
I didn't know.

539
00:40:47,320 --> 00:40:49,520
Then the photos he provided…

540
00:40:50,520 --> 00:40:51,920
I didn't take them.

541
00:40:52,000 --> 00:40:53,800
I also didn't know where he got them.

542
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:55,840
I don't really understand.

543
00:40:55,920 --> 00:40:58,000
Isn't this a violation of my privacy?

544
00:41:00,200 --> 00:41:02,640
I think we shouldn't
overcomplicate things.

545
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:06,080
What if Xie Yudi was just trying to help?

546
00:41:06,160 --> 00:41:08,720
As I recall, you two get along well.

547
00:41:08,800 --> 00:41:11,680
During that exam incident, he even
stepped in to explain things for you.

548
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:14,920
Maybe this time,
he was just trying to help you--

549
00:41:15,000 --> 00:41:15,840
Ma'am.

550
00:41:17,320 --> 00:41:19,880
What if there are people in this world

551
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:21,680
who offer help to others

552
00:41:22,480 --> 00:41:24,000
only to turn everyone against them?

553
00:41:25,600 --> 00:41:26,840
Turn everyone against them?

554
00:41:28,200 --> 00:41:29,760
I… I don't quite understand.

555
00:41:32,880 --> 00:41:33,920
It's getting late.

556
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:36,000
I have a tutoring job, so I'll be going.

557
00:41:38,680 --> 00:41:40,240
Turn everyone against them?

558
00:41:46,760 --> 00:41:49,080
DIRECTOR LIU

559
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:52,760
Director Liu.

560
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:54,440
<i>Have you checked the Campus Forum?</i>

561
00:41:54,520 --> 00:41:56,280
<i>Do you know what it's like right now?</i>

562
00:41:57,520 --> 00:41:59,320
I just spoke with Zheng Yu.

563
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:02,680
She knew nothing about the fundraiser
and strongly objected to it.

564
00:42:02,760 --> 00:42:05,520
I may need a little more time
to look into this.

565
00:42:05,600 --> 00:42:09,160
<i>Who said anything about Zheng Yu?</i>
<i>It's that student, Xie Yudi!</i>

566
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:12,000
<i>Everyone's saying he bullied a classmate.</i>

567
00:42:12,080 --> 00:42:13,640
<i>The rumors are spreading like wildfire!</i>

568
00:42:14,520 --> 00:42:17,000
<i>The city officials are here this week,</i>

569
00:42:17,080 --> 00:42:20,760
<i>and our college keeps getting</i>
<i>dragged into one mess after another!</i>

570
00:42:27,040 --> 00:42:29,280
Zhuang Ning, are you feeling any better?

571
00:42:30,280 --> 00:42:31,240
Much better.

572
00:42:31,320 --> 00:42:32,960
I just have a little cough left.

573
00:42:33,680 --> 00:42:35,120
That means you're almost better.

574
00:42:35,760 --> 00:42:36,960
When I get sick,

575
00:42:37,040 --> 00:42:39,160
a runny nose and a cough
are the final stage.

576
00:42:39,240 --> 00:42:41,080
It means the battle's almost over.

577
00:42:42,960 --> 00:42:44,760
Has Zheng Yu come back to the dorm?

578
00:42:45,280 --> 00:42:48,080
Didn't she go to the charity bazaar?

579
00:42:48,160 --> 00:42:49,760
Haven't you seen her?

580
00:42:55,920 --> 00:42:57,240
Did something happen?

581
00:43:13,560 --> 00:43:16,080
<i>You also keep putting up with Xie Yudi</i>

582
00:43:16,680 --> 00:43:17,880
<i>without saying a word.</i>

583
00:43:19,200 --> 00:43:20,800
<i>Why do you do that?</i>

584
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:23,400
I just don't get it.

585
00:43:23,480 --> 00:43:25,440
Why did the university
ask Zheng Yu to explain?

586
00:43:25,520 --> 00:43:26,960
She's not the one who caused all this.

587
00:43:29,320 --> 00:43:32,360
It's already this late,
and they still haven't let her come back.

588
00:43:32,440 --> 00:43:33,280
Exactly.

589
00:43:34,080 --> 00:43:35,440
I just don't understand.

590
00:43:35,520 --> 00:43:37,760
I mean, Xie Yudi is someone with a record.

591
00:43:37,840 --> 00:43:39,720
Shouldn't the university investigate him?

592
00:43:39,800 --> 00:43:42,000
I wish the person he bullied
would come forward.

593
00:43:42,080 --> 00:43:43,560
He deserves a good beating!

594
00:43:45,320 --> 00:43:47,400
Weren't they originally
high school classmates?

595
00:43:47,480 --> 00:43:49,320
It shouldn't be hard to find that person.

596
00:43:50,240 --> 00:43:51,440
But…

597
00:43:51,520 --> 00:43:52,800
It is not our place

598
00:43:52,880 --> 00:43:54,960
to tell those who have been hurt
that they must be brave.

599
00:44:00,080 --> 00:44:03,240
Where did you hear about Xie Yudi's past?

600
00:44:03,320 --> 00:44:05,000
People have been talking privately.

601
00:44:05,640 --> 00:44:07,880
Especially today.
Everything blew up after the fight.

602
00:44:07,960 --> 00:44:11,160
Zhuang Ning, it's obvious you don't really
scroll through the Campus Forum.

603
00:44:11,240 --> 00:44:13,120
It's full of posts about Xie Yudi now.

604
00:44:19,280 --> 00:44:23,160
XIE YUDI

605
00:44:30,960 --> 00:44:32,640
BULLIES LIKE HIM SHOULD BE EXPELLED!

606
00:44:32,720 --> 00:44:34,600
IF YOU KNOW XIE YUDI, STEP FORWARD.

607
00:44:34,680 --> 00:44:37,000
DAD

608
00:45:01,360 --> 00:45:02,600
Have you stared long enough?

609
00:45:05,360 --> 00:45:06,240
What do you want?

610
00:45:19,120 --> 00:45:21,840
All that random stuff that suddenly
surfaced these past two days…

611
00:45:23,640 --> 00:45:24,760
Did you post it?

612
00:45:31,160 --> 00:45:32,000
Forget it.

613
00:45:33,360 --> 00:45:34,800
It couldn't have been you.

614
00:45:37,640 --> 00:45:38,760
It doesn't matter.

615
00:45:39,960 --> 00:45:43,440
If you're called in and questioned
about it, just behave yourself.

616
00:45:45,160 --> 00:45:46,160
Like old times.

617
00:45:48,640 --> 00:45:49,480
Got it?

618
00:45:50,960 --> 00:45:52,160
Got it.

619
00:46:29,160 --> 00:46:30,240
Hello, ma'am.

620
00:46:34,160 --> 00:46:35,880
You're Gao Xing's tutor, right?

621
00:46:37,280 --> 00:46:38,400
I just finished tutoring her.

622
00:46:39,320 --> 00:46:42,080
You fixed my phone last time,
and I haven't thanked you yet.

623
00:46:42,160 --> 00:46:43,360
- Come in and sit down.
- It's--

624
00:46:43,440 --> 00:46:45,120
I'll be right back
after taking out the trash.

625
00:46:45,200 --> 00:46:49,480
It's fine. I was just passing by
and wanted to say hello.

626
00:46:55,000 --> 00:46:56,440
You're here to see Yanzhou, aren't you?

627
00:46:58,800 --> 00:47:01,880
I'm sorry, but he went to see Yanan today
to talk about studies.

628
00:47:01,960 --> 00:47:04,200
He decided to stay the night there
just in case they talk late.

629
00:47:13,600 --> 00:47:16,200
Some people enjoy getting into fights,

630
00:47:16,280 --> 00:47:17,120
but once they're hurt,

631
00:47:17,200 --> 00:47:20,240
they're afraid their parents will find out
and don't even dare go home.

632
00:47:28,720 --> 00:47:30,400
Just one can, okay?
Don't make this a habit.

633
00:47:37,200 --> 00:47:39,160
An injured hand is no big deal.

634
00:47:39,240 --> 00:47:41,720
But if something happens to your heart,
how will you do experiments?

635
00:47:42,320 --> 00:47:44,520
You'll just have to lie there
and be the test subject.

636
00:47:46,400 --> 00:47:48,440
Come on, tell me.
There's no one else around now.

637
00:47:54,600 --> 00:47:56,800
Why did you fight Xie Yudi?

638
00:47:56,880 --> 00:47:58,920
What happened
that made fighting seem necessary?

639
00:48:00,800 --> 00:48:02,480
I did it because family is
the bottom line.

640
00:48:05,280 --> 00:48:07,040
Once it sank in for her

641
00:48:07,120 --> 00:48:12,640
that as her mom's child,
she did nothing at all in that situation,

642
00:48:14,080 --> 00:48:15,640
her heart would hurt.

643
00:48:16,800 --> 00:48:17,640
So…

644
00:48:19,640 --> 00:48:20,760
I did it for her.

645
00:48:40,120 --> 00:48:42,280
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

646
00:49:27,320 --> 00:49:28,480
RECENT

647
00:49:42,120 --> 00:49:45,000
CHEN YANZHOU

648
00:51:36,800 --> 00:51:39,080
What are you doing here?

649
00:51:42,840 --> 00:51:45,200
I was looking for a quiet place to study,

650
00:51:45,800 --> 00:51:46,800
and then I saw you.

651
00:51:50,480 --> 00:51:53,400
You haven't put medicine
on your forehead yet, have you?

652
00:52:13,880 --> 00:52:16,080
Thank you for today.

653
00:52:18,920 --> 00:52:21,520
Ever since my mom got sick,

654
00:52:21,600 --> 00:52:23,640
I haven't really
looked closely at her face.

655
00:52:24,600 --> 00:52:27,680
So at first, I didn't quite process it.

656
00:52:29,760 --> 00:52:31,600
You have classes and part-time work.

657
00:52:31,680 --> 00:52:33,080
You're busy.

658
00:52:33,160 --> 00:52:34,320
It's completely normal.

659
00:52:37,520 --> 00:52:38,960
I was afraid to look too closely,

660
00:52:40,000 --> 00:52:44,160
because if I did,
I'd see how terribly thin she'd become,

661
00:52:44,240 --> 00:52:47,640
looking nothing like how she used to be.

662
00:52:50,760 --> 00:52:53,720
I was afraid that if I looked too closely,

663
00:52:54,480 --> 00:52:55,760
I'd be the one to break down.

664
00:52:59,600 --> 00:53:00,760
So

665
00:53:01,760 --> 00:53:04,280
thank you for putting a stop to it all.

666
00:53:13,720 --> 00:53:14,960
By the way,

667
00:53:15,040 --> 00:53:17,360
has the university given you any trouble?

668
00:53:18,680 --> 00:53:20,680
Don't worry. I'll be fine.

669
00:53:20,760 --> 00:53:21,880
That's good.

670
00:53:22,440 --> 00:53:24,400
Your mom said you weren't
coming home tonight.

671
00:53:24,480 --> 00:53:26,920
I was worried something else
might have happened to you.

672
00:53:28,120 --> 00:53:30,600
You went to my house looking for me?

673
00:53:33,240 --> 00:53:34,520
You helped me,

674
00:53:35,160 --> 00:53:36,880
so of course I wanted to thank you.

675
00:53:58,160 --> 00:53:59,480
Are you okay?

676
00:54:33,800 --> 00:54:35,480
I… I'm going to wash my hands.

677
00:57:53,200 --> 00:57:58,200
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
